cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the thesis and the repository."
title: "A Neuro-Symbolic Clinical Decision Support System for Early Alzheimer's Detection"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, neuro-symbolic clinical decision support system for early
  Alzheimer's disease detection from structural MRI. The system combines a
  7-channel 2.5D extraction pipeline, an ensemble of compact CNN and transformer
  models, Grad-CAM explanations, and a deterministic MMSE-based clinical gate.
authors:
